---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

  <main class="dashboard-container">
    <div class="user-panel">
      <aside class="user-sidebar">
        <div class="decorative-lines"></div>
        <div class="user-avatar">
          <span class="avatar-text">U1</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="user-name">Usuario 1</h2>
        <p class="user-role">Aprendiz SENA</p>
      </aside>

      <section class="user-content">
        <div class="content-card info-card">
          <div class="card-header">
            <span class="icon">ℹ️</span>
            <h3>Información</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <p>Bienvenido a tu panel. Aquí puedes visualizar tu información personal, estado de matrícula y novedades de tu programa de formación.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="content-card schedule-card">
          <div class="card-header">
            <span class="icon">📅</span>
            <h3>Horario</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <p>Consulta tus ambientes de aprendizaje, competencias y los instructores asignados a tu ficha.</p>
            <ul class="schedule-list">
              <li><strong>Lunes 8:00 AM</strong> - Programación Web (Ambiente 101)</li>
              <li><strong>Martes 10:00 AM</strong> - Bases de Datos (Ambiente 204)</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>

<style>
  .dashboard-container {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 3rem auto;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .user-panel {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .user-panel {
      flex-direction: row;
      min-height: 450px;
    }
  }

  .user-sidebar {
    background-color: #f9fafb;
    padding: 3rem 2rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    border-right: 1px solid #eaeaea;
    position: relative;
    min-width: 280px;
  }

  .decorative-lines {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 8px;
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(
      45deg,
      #39A900,
      #39A900 15px,
      #ffffff 15px,
      #ffffff 20px
    );
  }

  .user-avatar {
    width: 100px;
    height: 100px;
    background-color: #39A900;
    color: white;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(57, 169, 0, 0.2);
  }

  .user-name {
    color: #333;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .user-role {
    color: #666;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .user-content {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 2.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
    background-color: #ffffff;
  }

  .content-card {
    border: 1px solid #eaeaea;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
  }

  .content-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
  }

  .info-card {
    border-left: 4px solid #39A900;
  }

  .schedule-card {
    border-left: 4px solid #0078D4;
  }

  .card-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;
    padding-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .card-header h3 {
    color: #2c3e50;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .card-body p {
    color: #555;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .schedule-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .schedule-list li {
    background-color: #f8f9fa;
    padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: #444;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    border-left: 3px solid #e9ecef;
  }

  .schedule-list li strong {
    color: #39A900;
  }
</style>